+// novabrowser: role-aware `-apple-color-filter` for a Chromium-like dark mode. A background is
+// never made lighter and text is never made darker, so parts of a page that are already dark
+// (a dark header, light text on it) stay as they are. Any = the filter as WebKit applies it.
+enum class ColorFilterRole : uint8_t { Any, Background, Foreground };
